▶ 5. Consulta direta a cada shard: cada conta só existe no nó da sua região
  pg-europa:
  $ psql "host=pg-europa.global.local,pg-europa-replica.global.local target_session_attrs=read-write dbname=bank" -c "SELECT iban, currency, balance FROM accounts WHERE user_id IN ('2c87f087-90f7-46db-bf42-690ea0dad367','f763667d-29f7-4b17-9a5e-e36a19cfb022')"
          iban      | currency | balance 
    ----------------+----------+---------
     GS-EU-00000004 | EUR      |    0.00
    (1 row)
    
  pg-america:
  $ psql "host=pg-america.global.local,pg-america-replica.global.local target_session_attrs=read-write dbname=bank" -c "SELECT iban, currency, balance FROM accounts WHERE user_id IN ('2c87f087-90f7-46db-bf42-690ea0dad367','f763667d-29f7-4b17-9a5e-e36a19cfb022')"
          iban      | currency | balance 
    ----------------+----------+---------
     GS-AM-00000038 | USD      |    0.00
    (1 row)
    
  ✔ GS-EU-00000004 só no pg-europa, GS-AM-00000038 só no pg-america
  a réplica também a tem (replicação streaming):
  $ psql "host=pg-europa-replica.global.local dbname=bank" -c "SELECT iban, pg_is_in_recovery() AS replica FROM accounts WHERE iban = 'GS-EU-00000004'"
          iban      | replica 
    ----------------+---------
     GS-EU-00000004 | t
    (1 row)
    

